sm64ex for the onn box: arm64 bionic, GLES2 via zink, SDL offscreen + ONNM4 present.
- Makefile: build host tools with cc/c++; USE_GLES=1 now really passes -DUSE_GLES (was RPi-only)
  and links -lGLESv2; no -lpthread (bionic has it in libc)
- gfx_sdl2.c: GLES -> no depth on the surfaceless pbuffer (the present FBOs carry depth), window at
  0,0 with SDL_WINDOW_OPENGL only, abort with SDL_GetError() if the window or context is NULL
- gfx_opengl.c + gfx_gles_loader.[ch]: resolve the 37 GLES entry points via SDL_GL_GetProcAddress
  (generated by gen-gles-loader.py; harmless belt-and-braces now that -DUSE_GLES is real)
- audio_sdl2.c: missing <stdio.h>
Base: sm64ex d7ca2c0. Recipe: see BUILD.md next to this patch. Bring your own ROM.

